{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"diagnosis\":\"The proof can use HomBisimilarity.follow_fst/follow_snd directly, avoiding repeated unpacking of the underlying bisimulation witness and calls to le_bisimilarity. Explicit transition cases keep elaboration predictable while reducing syntax and heartbeats.\",\"proof_body\":\"by\\n  intro h\\n  use @ChoiceBisim _ _ defs, ChoiceBisim.choice h\\n  intro s₁ s₂ hr μ\\n  constructor\\n  case left =>\\n    intro s₁' ht\\n    cases hr\\n    case choice p q r h =>\\n      cases ht\\n      case choiceL a b c ht =>\\n        obtain ⟨q', ht, h'⟩ := h.follow_fst ht\\n        exact ⟨q', Tr.choiceL ht, ChoiceBisim.bisim h'⟩\\n      case choiceR a b c ht =>\\n        exact ⟨s₁', Tr.choiceR ht, ChoiceBisim.bisim HomBisimilarity.refl⟩\\n    case bisim h =>\\n      obtain ⟨q', ht, h'⟩ := h.follow_fst ht\\n      exact ⟨q', ht, ChoiceBisim.bisim h'⟩\\n  case right =>\\n    intro s₂' ht\\n    cases hr\\n    case choice p q r h =>\\n      cases ht\\n      case choiceL a b c ht =>\\n        obtain ⟨p', ht, h'⟩ := h.follow_snd ht\\n        exact ⟨p', Tr.choiceL ht, ChoiceBisim.bisim h'⟩\\n      case choiceR a b c ht =>\\n        exact ⟨s₂', Tr.choiceR ht, ChoiceBisim.bisim HomBisimilarity.refl⟩\\n    case bisim h =>\\n      obtain ⟨p', ht, h'⟩ := h.follow_snd ht\\n      exact ⟨p', ht, ChoiceBisim.bisim h'⟩\"}"}}
